 where a contact was met. Support w/ in add and edit, validate values, and preserve compatibility with saved contacts that omit the field.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":163,"deletions":23},"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":146,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"960901eb238839e52d3e623a9055120b1acc121a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from ViincentLim/40-add-wheremet-field","messageBody":"Add optional WhereMet field to contacts","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-15T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"18e508a5600097c30b63987163a725383b0b8ab4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add application edit and delete commands","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":425,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":38,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":566,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"1d7fc2c0553e6c81f2bda07bc775c2fe895e3052","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #66 from ViincentLim/59-application-edit-delete","messageBody":"Implement Application Edit and Delete Workflow","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"henrlly":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"112f0af32984dbb5d1a0adc62d1084b357cf6d20","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"AboutUs: Add Henry Lee\u0027s profile","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":11,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"486f1da34a59eafe4a95490c83628de2d949dbb1","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #11 from henrlly/add-henry-about-us","messageBody":"AboutUs: Add Henry Lee\u0027s profile","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"50202455f3ce7a2cbde9b09373203aa19fdef9c3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #22 from bedminer1/21-update-aboutus-with-alex-info","messageBody":"Update Aboutus with Alex Info","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"300d0754420c5e50dedfc5a3d5ae8255393f1308","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Company field to contacts","messageBody":"InternTrack contacts are recruiters, engineers and alumni, so users\nneed to record which company each contact works at. AB3\u0027s Person has\nno such field.\n\nLet\u0027s add an optional Company field, set with the c/ prefix in the\nadd and edit commands. It is saved to the data file and shown on the\ncontact card.\n\nCompany is optional for now so that existing data files, sample data\nand tests keep working. It will be made compulsory once the other\ncontact fields (role, where met) are in place.\n\nValidation follows the feature spec: not blank; only letters, digits,\nspaces and \u0026 . , \u0027 -; at most 100 characters.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":174,"deletions":24},"docs":{"insertions":8,"deletions":4},"test-code":{"insertions":185,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"d21eb60b07356cf96379e5d60b8bf905b9e808cd","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #43 from henrlly/38-add-company-field","messageBody":"Add Company field to contacts","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"1b7a1aca38fce820d3d7f1dc1dfe593ab7048728","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"ListCommand: report contact count and empty list","messageBody":"The list command always replied \"Listed all persons.\", which uses\nAddressBook terminology and gives no feedback when there are no\ncontacts to show.\n\nLet\u0027s report how many contacts were listed, and show a dedicated\nmessage suggesting the add command when the contact list is empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":9,"deletions":3},"test-code":{"insertions":13,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"3d30985eb185ede35bda1cf70031f5d1615104bf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"PersonCard: label and reorder contact fields","messageBody":"Contact cards showed bare values, making it hard to tell apart fields\nsuch as Company and Role, and an empty contact list was shown as a\nblank panel.\n\nLet\u0027s prefix each field with its label, order the fields as Name,\nCompany, Role, Email, Phone and Where Met, hide an empty remark, and\nshow a placeholder message when there are no contacts to display.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":39,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"dd4d71fbb8d4f2027ccd0daeea05b4935734d9f3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"SampleDataUtil: use InternTrack sample contacts","messageBody":"Sample contacts had no Where Met value and used AddressBook tags such\nas \"friends\" and \"family\", which do not fit an internship networking\napp.\n\nLet\u0027s give each sample contact a Where Met value and replace the tags\nwith networking ones such as \"recruiter\" and \"alumni\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":19,"deletions":12}}},{"hash":"0c4da0aeabead8ef2a8b2ff635cb72c5fd7d6c6b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"UserGuide: update list command section","messageBody":"The list command section still referred to persons in an address book\nand did not describe what each contact card shows.\n\nLet\u0027s describe the fields shown on each card, the empty-list behaviour,\nand add a screenshot of the result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":12,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"f28a47f80284ae52ac12cbd3ec636c19315318c8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #64 from henrlly/57-contact-directory-view","messageBody":"Complete contact directory view","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"AmyLiiiii":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"d1a6bbe1db49123fd57c8fa2c5de6894a28026ad","isMergeCommit":false,"message